Hey! It does!  Thanks for setting out the sequence.  So I just plugged
it into Excel, err, I mean OpenOffice, of course, and used the
following:

(odds of non-hostile)*(odds of a demon)*(odds of fountain not
drying)*(sequence)
(1-(80+DLVL)/100)*(1/30)*sum( (2/3)^(i-1) )
=3D .01899
so each fountain on DLVL=3D1 has a 2% chance of giving a wish.
